{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17side_level_act17side_05_beg","groupId":"act17side","stageId":"act17side_05","title":"燈塔控制室","storyCode":"SN-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17side/level_act17side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c051e9041324b35382237b16ef7ed00f7c0dc2e3db2c1c439424a783ba37de06","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你等不及了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"如果凱爾希說的那些是真的，那我們大概都等不及了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我們行走在陸地上，我們還是存在於海裡。那些腐敗的後裔......它們在改變的是“環境”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"我們遲早無法倖免。現在是在坐以待斃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坐以待斃的不止我們，而且大家的原因還都不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想開點，說不定只是這片大地不適合我們生存了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（表示贊同的獨奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"音樂......還不夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想做點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了音樂，做點什麼吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（表示贊同的獨奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......在這等著也是等著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就當演唱會前的體能訓練吧，別遊太遠，Frost。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......體能訓練，那你們？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Aya","speakerId":"npc_2001_Aya_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Alty","speakerId":"npc_2004_Alty","isRemote":false,"text":"我懶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dan","speakerId":"npc_2002_Dan_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺就快要把靈感完成了，就差一點，一丁點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。（激昂的獨奏）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Frost","speakerId":"npc_2003_Frost_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我出發了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喘息的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈啊......哈啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喘息的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那個審判官和那個女人做了什麼，他們怎麼能這麼輕易地抹除海的恩賜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喘息的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾......一定是阿戈爾人，那些阿戈爾人留下的東西，那些古怪的機械！必須要毀掉那些機械！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（攀附上小腿的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喘息的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......兄弟，懲戒軍已經包圍了這裡，突圍失敗了......我們無路可退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喘息的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——我們尊敬的先知已經回到了海洋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喘息的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們所要做的，只剩下，為她鋪平道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（急躁的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喘息的教徒","speakerId":"avg_npc_454_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他們想要阻攔潮汐，就讓我們去毀滅他們，我的生命也只是漫長道路的一小部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別慌，是我。你怎麼沒去避難？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂、蒂亞戈鎮長......我喝醉了，睡得像頭鉗獸，啥也沒聽見......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"結果我醒過來的時候，外面亂糟糟的，地上全是這種噁心的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡發生什麼了？審判庭來人了嗎？我們會怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大海沒有犯下任何罪過，但審判庭不同，他們捏著所謂的律法，他們判我們有罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要等一段時間，恐魚會回到海裡的......但是我不能讓審判官就這麼宣判格蘭法洛死刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼——你瘋了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒瘋！我只是想知道！在審判庭摧毀這座小鎮，然後把我們全部抓走審訊之前，我們還應該做什麼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官早就在這裡了，我躲在小巷子裡看見過那個人。我從來沒見過那麼老的審判官，我有種不好的預感......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你打算怎麼辦，蒂亞戈？難道你要衝到他面前講道理？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又到了選邊站的時候，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈爾人被帶走的時候，大部分人就那麼看著，他們也有機會站在阿戈爾人那邊，但是沒人站出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在，我們又有個機會。看著審判庭把格蘭法洛的全部人帶走審判，或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你瘋了？！審判官，審判官欸！他解決我們都不需要動手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帶我去見他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別裝了。你以為我在這座小鎮生活了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"驚疑不定的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，跟我來。如果你的目標真的是向審判官復仇的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亞戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"極境","speakerId":"avg_npc_450_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈鎮長，你到底......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就快了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已經很慢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，是我太急躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那個......審判官閣下，如果您擔心其他幾位，可以去幫他們的。這裡有我就夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官給我的任務是保護你。那些怪物無孔不入，你也看見了，我不能輕易離開你的身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我不想變成您無法戰鬥的理由，我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要你能點亮這座塔，長官的判斷就是正確的。我只是服從長官的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你關於這座伊比利亞之眼的知識，是來自你的父母？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，準確來說，是整座格蘭法洛過往生活的結晶。他們都是伊比利亞最好的燈塔工程師，起碼蒂亞戈叔叔是這麼告訴我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那裡曾是審判庭劃定的陣地，直到連續發生了數起與阿戈爾人和深海教會有關的案件而遭到廢棄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是想揭你的傷疤，我只是在想......出發前我閱覽過當時的判決的卷宗......不，沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不討厭審判庭嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......這個......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那座小鎮上真的有什麼壓得人喘不過氣，除了天上散不開的烏雲，就只有“審判庭”三個字了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那座小鎮曾閃閃發亮，給了我們重建家園的信心。工人和工程師們一腔熱忱，對抗災難，但在災難來臨之前，審判庭就奪走了一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天仍舊這麼認為？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是在那裡長大的。我能看到和聽到的，都這麼告訴我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，呃，抱歉。審判官閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你只是如實陳述，市民。你的行為會證明你是個忠誠於伊比利亞的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但我很意外，原來你敢當著審判官的面說這些話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到這裡之前，我當然不敢......但是......我見到了伊比利亞之眼。長久以來，它只在我的夢裡出現，只是廣場上的一座雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每一個格蘭法洛的長輩都在口口相傳的，我們本該做到的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在其實非常感動——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，審判官閣下，塔的下面是不是有什麼東西在發亮？藍色的，星星點點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——溟痕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的在和我戰鬥嗎？騎士先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼裡只有這座燈塔，為什麼？你為什麼要執著於它？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪......滔天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小麥都應閉口無言，碩物將傾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激動的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"他能言語，但卻沒有號令他的族群。恐魚在混亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我們當速戰速決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沙啞的咆哮）——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——真讓人驚訝，騎士先生，你的動作似乎和剛才不太一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"人類的動作。庫蘭塔騎士獨有的衝鋒起步。你究竟是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士仍舊沒有理睬二人。他將目光投向了第三個方向。\n巨大的燈塔沒有因為他的攻擊撼動分毫。即使是大靜謐都沒能摧毀伊比利亞之眼，何況一個騎士？\n這讓他感到困惑。也讓他更加躍躍欲試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沙啞的低吟）雲，群巒，灰燼......陳列在腐蝕的溫床。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"浪花......不滅......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（激烈地蠕動）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"恐魚被你吸引，你負傷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎是這樣。只是不小心擦傷——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓開。你不適合繼續戰鬥。"},{"type":"narration","text":"達里奧迅速掃視了一眼面前的深海獵人。她明顯在剛才的纏鬥中表露出了數次不自然的停頓。\n達里奧聽過關於她的一些報告。她與鹽風城的實驗有關，與那場激戰之後，達里奧親眼所見的那個女人大不相同。\n她是誰？她現在是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你應該沒有大礙，可你連站都站不穩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"是鹽風城時落下的病根？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......海風讓人有些沉醉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......騎士......同胞。為什麼，你要咀嚼空氣，你要感受溫度，你從不享用，文明的果實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"地面在震動。\n久違的能量正順著管線充盈著伊比利亞之眼殘破的軀體，以支撐它睜開眼眸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它醒了。整座小島低吟著初醒的囈語，就像睡了幾個世紀一樣漫長，它將把冬天從身上撤去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......萬物之輪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它不屬於海......"},{"type":"narration","text":"騎士在巨大的燈塔陰影中仰頭觀望。\n他在迷茫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......這不是巨浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨浪，何在？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"並沒有任何氣息，彷彿陰影順著光芒的方向傾斜那般自然，幽靈鯊揮舞著武器。\n卻被眼前這只人形的海嗣以不可思議的爆發力避開。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"半空中的騎士凝望著遠方。\n他在聽，新的海浪將至。他要去擊碎海浪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......Ishar......mla......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沙啞的咆哮）——羅辛——南特——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g24_cloudy_sea"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅辛南特","speakerId":"avg_npc_463_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶鳴）——！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"最後的騎士","speakerId":"avg_npc_448_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不清晰的發音）追！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g19_lighthouse_front"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來騎士先生會害怕光芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"別追，這樣的海嗣不止一隻，護衛燈塔，才是任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"騎士先生只是對燈塔失去了興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"我對怪物的動機也沒有興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在說，我也是怪物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"你正在發生變化。我並不清楚這種變化是否會發生在每一個深海獵人身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果有必要，這片礁石將是你們最後踏足的陸地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們明明被海洋環繞，你還稱這裡作陸地？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"因災難而改變的是海岸線，不是國境線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"被大靜謐吞噬的每一寸土地仍然服從於伊比利亞的律法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幽靈鯊","speakerId":"avg_1023_ghost2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"律法，高尚的詞語。但並非所有生靈都認可這種高尚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大審判官達里奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_183","isRemote":false,"text":"......準備迎戰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g20_lighthouse_core"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還、還差最後一點！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（蠕動的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還差一點就快點！再這樣拖下去，這座塔會被溟痕吞噬的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......遇到了一點麻煩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許是哪個附屬建築遭到了損傷，可、可就算排查，也太花時間了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要打開核心設施就行，我們需要調取大船的位置資訊，最好能重建與海岸線的聯絡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我明白了，但是——恐怕那些東西在更上面的地方！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就走！快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必須留在這裡......開啟大燈塔只需要拉下最顯眼的那個開關，但我得在這裡盯著電力系統重啟完畢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判官閣下，您上去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼——可如果你被漏網的恐魚襲擊了，我們就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道——但是，我、我也不想功虧一簣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些怪物——它們就算主動襲擊人類，也只是因為我們入侵了它們的巢穴，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真是這樣，它們是不會繼續破壞這些設備的，發生戰鬥反而比較危險，您上去吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......主開關是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"喬迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，最顯眼的拉杆，至少能保證燈光設備在內的主要設備都恢復運作......那個，只要筆記上沒寫錯的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就回來，喬迪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制台......唔，是這個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從塔里看不見外面的情況。\n那艘斯圖提斐拉真的還沒有沉沒？他們要如何找到那艘大船？\n懲戒軍來不來得及援助長官與獵人們？格蘭法洛的深海教徒是不是還藏著更多秘密？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只要拉下手裡的拉杆，這一切就會得到解答。\n艾麗妮本該困惑。她接受了太多。她知曉了海洋的種種，她也親眼目睹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——時候到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你準備好了，艾麗妮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刺眼的光穿透了海洋，穿透了一切。\n光會引領方向，光能驅散陰影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......成功了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！喬迪！你看得見嗎！我們成功——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐魚","speakerId":"avg_npc_457_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摩擦牆面的窸窣聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"審判官艾麗妮","speakerId":"avg_4009_irene_1","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g18_lighthouse_square"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來你還有心思欣賞這座雕塑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊比利亞之眼......阿戈爾與伊比利亞技術結合的結晶。陸地上，只有移動城市一城之內可以無障礙通訊，跨城，則如隔天塹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有通訊手段能解決富源石環境帶來的干擾。唯一的辦法，是冒著隨時因天災毀棄的風險架設基站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽說有的國家已經擁有了移動基站的技術，在各個城市間以固定軌道航行，那些工程師，與守衛燈塔之人，其實並無差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使到了今天，人類在這片大地上，仍在冥行盲索，不得其道。大家都在用同樣的方式摸索著泰拉大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，海洋呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"海洋中沒有源石。阿戈爾的通訊技術遠領先於陸地各國，伊比利亞之眼不只是一座燈塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，它是伊比利亞的眼。而且極少有人知道，它是布雷奧甘留給我們的，連通伊比利亞的話筒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，久疏問候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"審判庭能如此迅速地對凱爾希女士的提議做出反應，你們功不可沒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何，在格蘭法洛的日子還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起其他同僚蟄伏的城市，這裡談不上危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，你在這裡有什麼發現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，長官。我所知的，恐怕不比您和這位女士多出多少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大審判官閣下給我的命令是監視格蘭法洛是否存在更多潛在的敵人，違背我們的律法，褻瀆我們的國家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的結論是沒有。只是暫時沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在深海教徒出現的時候，你並沒有及時通知你所屬的隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我判斷那些邪教徒不成氣候，懲戒軍撤離，正是釣出這些幕後黑手的好時機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的領袖是誰？是否有更多的......虛假的主教，主持著海洋對陸地的侵襲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的領袖......我只有猜測，沒有證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鎮長蒂亞戈，來自伊比利亞腹地的工人，現在是這座小鎮名義上的鎮長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自伊比利亞之眼計畫廢止，審判庭迅速清理了格蘭法洛中的叛徒後，他就對審判庭頗有微詞，且毫不掩飾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亞戈......格蘭法洛的工人，他窩藏著邪教徒，看來，他就是我們的目標了，凱爾希女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凱爾希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還有一件事，那個，卡門長官。懲戒軍似乎遭遇了襲擊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"聖徒卡門","speakerId":"avg_npc_447_1","isRemote":false,"text":"懲戒軍投入了一個大陣的兵力，僅憑盤踞在格蘭法洛的這點邪惡，連看清他們的徽記都是奢求。他們遇到了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"溟痕從地下滲至地表，在格蘭法洛周圍五十公里左右......劃了一個圓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，是一個完美的圓。就像用圓規畫出的那樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷靜的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_461_1","isRemote":false,"text":"被包圍的不是這座小鎮，而是我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凱爾希"]}]}
